From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pravalika Gurram <pravalika.gurram@intel.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 19:31:18 +0530
Subject: backport_only: Drop force_probe requirement for CRI

Remove the force_probe requirement to enable the platform
support by default for Xe KMD Backport Kernel.

Signed-off-by: Pravalika Gurram <pravalika.gurram@intel.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_pci.c | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_pci.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_pci.c
index aab0f6369..2f68bdc6f 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_pci.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_pci.c
@@ -484,7 +484,6 @@ static const struct xe_device_desc cri_desc = {
 	.has_sysctrl = true,
 	.max_gt_per_tile = 2,
 	MULTI_LRC_MASK,
-	.require_force_probe = true,
 	.va_bits = 57,
 	.vm_max_level = 4,
 };
